#: ../../source/reference/frame.rst:13
msgid ""
"The Frame class represents a graphical frame or border used in user "
"interfaces. It is designed to visually group or contain other UI "
"elements, providing a clear separation or visual boundary. The frame can "
"have customizable corners, border width, and border color, making it a "
"versatile element for organizing and structuring content within an "
"application."
msgstr ""

